  <ferc:DisclosureOfExtraordinaryIncomeOrExtraordinaryDeductionAmountsTextBlock id="f-10" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%;padding-left:9.67pt;text-decoration:underline"&gt;LEASES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;The FERC guidance requires all leases, finance and operating, to be recorded within existing FERC balance sheet accounts designated for capitalized leases (FERC accounts 101.1, 227, &amp;amp; 243). As of December 31, 2025, total lease assets for the Company are presented within 101.1 as follows:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:67.708%"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:53.185%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:1.0%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:44.615%"/&gt;&lt;td style="width:0.1%"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="6" style="background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:24pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:115%"&gt;Leases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height:15pt"&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:2px 1pt 2px 25pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Finance Leases (net)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;643,093&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" style="background-color:#f2f2f2;padding:0 1pt"/&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#f2f2f2;border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0 2px 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;$&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#f2f2f2;border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;643,093&#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background-color:#f2f2f2;border-bottom:1pt solid #000;border-top:1pt solid #000;padding:2px 1pt 2px 0;text-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfExtraordinaryIncomeOrExtraordinaryDeductionAmountsTextBlock>
