      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Other changes reported for Construction Work in Progress represents closures to in service assets and consist primarily of various hardware and software projects.</span>
